因此\[\frac{\lg a_{n+1}+\lg a_{n+2}+\cdots+\lg a_{2n}}{n^2}
=\frac{(n+1)\lg2+(n+2)\lg2+\cdots+2n\lg2}{n^2}\]\[=\frac{(n+1)+(n+2)+\cdots+2n}{n^2}\lg2
